OL,3,AJames Bay performs with broken ankle at
OL,4,ABon Jovi gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Bay came on stage in a wheelchair
OL,7,Fto support Bon Jovi at Wembley Stadium
OL,8,Fon Wednesday.
OL,10,FThe Brit Award-winning
OL,11,Fsinger-songwriter, born in Hitchin,
OL,12,FHertfordshire, had broken his ankle the
OL,13,Fday before.
OL,15,FThe 36-year-old had to perform while
OL,16,Fsitting down, with his left leg and
OL,17,Fankle in a cast.
OL,19,FIn a caption on Instagram, the venue
OL,20,Fsaid the star had broken "his ankle on
OL,21,FTuesday... but still supported Bon Jovi
OL,22,Fon Wednesday".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
